{{define "main"}}
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative py-14 md:py-16 px-gutter overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-lowest border-b border-outline-variant" id="cybersecurity-insurance-hero">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-low rounded-full border border-outline-variant">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-size-sm text-primary">shield_with_heart</span>
            <span class="font-label text-label-sm text-on-surface">Cyber Risk Transfer, Backed by Cyber Defense</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-display-lg text-on-background mb-6 md:mb-8 max-w-4xl">
            Cybersecurity Insurance Built on <span class="text-primary">Evidence, Not Assumptions</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-body text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl">
            Tabiri combines penetration testing, continuous monitoring, and practical remediation with an insurance-readiness strategy designed to help organizations understand, reduce, and transfer cyber risk.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 md:mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto">
            <a class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto" href="/contact">Discuss Cyber Insurance Readiness</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Integrated Protection -->
<section class="py-12 bg-surface-container-low border-b border-outline-variant" id="integrated-protection">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter">
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
            <p class="font-label text-label-sm text-accent mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Integrated Protection</p>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-background mb-4">Reduce the Risk. <span class="text-primary">Prepare to Transfer the Rest.</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">A point-in-time questionnaire cannot capture a risk environment that changes every day. Our approach keeps technical evidence connected to ongoing risk management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">policy</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Validate Exposure</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Engineer-led penetration testing identifies exploitable attack paths and produces evidence that can support a clearer view of your security posture.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">monitor_heart</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Monitor Change</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring detects emerging vulnerabilities and configuration changes between assessments, when yesterday's risk picture may no longer apply.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">health_and_safety</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Improve Resilience</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Prioritized remediation and ongoing security operations help reduce the likelihood and potential impact of an incident before risk is transferred.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Coverage Areas -->
<section class="py-12 bg-surface-container-lowest" id="potential-coverage-areas">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,3fr)_minmax(0,5fr)] gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        <div>
            <p class="font-label text-label-sm text-accent mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Potential Coverage Areas</p>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-background mb-4"><span class="text-primary">Financial Protection</span> for Cyber Events</h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Cyber policies commonly combine first-party expenses with third-party liabilities. Exact coverage, limits, deductibles, conditions, and exclusions vary by carrier and policy.</p>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-6">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">info</span>
                    <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Insurance products, where available, are offered through appropriately licensed insurance partners. Coverage is subject to underwriting and the terms of the issued policy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover px-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">database</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-primary">Data Recovery</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Costs to restore data and systems damaged, destroyed, or stolen in a covered event.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover px-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">encrypted</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-primary">Cyber Extortion</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Response expenses associated with ransomware and other covered extortion demands.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover px-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">notifications</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-primary">Breach Response</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Potential notification, forensic investigation, legal, credit monitoring, and crisis costs.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover px-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="icon-tile group-hover:bg-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-hover:text-white">gavel</span></div>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-primary">Cyber Liability</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Potential network security, privacy, media, and regulatory liabilities arising from a covered incident.</p>
            </article>                   
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Risk Model -->
<section class="py-12 bg-surface-container-low border-y border-outline-variant" id="risk-informed-approach">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter">
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
            <p class="font-label text-label-sm text-accent mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Risk-Informed Approach</p>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-background mb-4">Security Evidence That Supports <span class="text-primary">Insurance Readiness</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">Tabiri helps organizations implement security measures that align with insurance requirements, ensuring readiness and risk mitigation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <span class="font-label text-lg text-primary">01</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Understand the Business</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Review revenue, operations, sensitive data, dependencies, prior incidents, and the financial impact of downtime.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <span class="font-label text-lg text-primary">02</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Assess Technical Risk</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Test external and internal systems to identify weaknesses that automated questionnaires and perimeter scans can miss.</p>
            </article>  
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <span class="font-label text-lg text-primary">03</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Reduce Exposure</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Prioritize remediation by exploitability and business impact, then verify that material weaknesses are resolved.</p>
            </article>  
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <span class="font-label text-lg text-primary">04</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface"><span class="text-primary">Maintain the Evidence</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Use continuous monitoring and reporting to keep the security posture current through underwriting and renewal cycles.</p>
            </article>                    
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Tabiri -->
<section class="py-12 bg-surface-container-lowest" id="why-tabiri-insurance">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
            <p class="font-label text-label-sm text-accent mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Why Tabiri</p>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-background mb-4">More Than a <span class="text-primary">One-Time Scan</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Many cyber insurance assessments see only the public perimeter at one moment in time. Tabiri's security services can examine the systems, identities, workflows, and controls behind that perimeter, helping keep your premiums low.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover flex items-start gap-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Validated Findings</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Human-reviewed evidence distinguishes exploitable risk from scanner noise.</p></div></div>
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover flex items-start gap-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Ongoing Risk Management</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Monitoring and remediation continue after the initial assessment.</p></div></div>
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover flex items-start gap-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Aligned Incentives</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">The goal is not simply to document risk, but to prevent losses and strengthen resilience.</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section class="py-12 px-gutter bg-surface-container-lowest" id="cybersecurity-insurance-cta">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto rounded-3xl bg-[#e2e7ff] p-8 md:p-12 text-center text-on-surface relative overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant shadow-lg">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#1a45d2]/5 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <p class="font-label text-label-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary mb-4">Start with Your Risk</p>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-display-lg text-center mb-4">Build a Stronger Case for <span class="text-primary">Cyber Resilience</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">Talk with our team about your environment, insurance goals, and the security evidence needed to move forward.</p>
            <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Start the Conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{{end}}